WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,900
Even if I'm not star-chasing, the more I know Xia Qinyou's name

2
00:00:03,900 --> 00:00:07,100
Filmmaker, three-ring star, the little pride of Jiangcheng

3
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:09,100
The dream goddess of countless men

4
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,310
Do you know her and know where she lives?

5
00:00:12,310 --> 00:00:15,080
I don't know

6
00:00:15,080 --> 00:00:25,140
I need to know my address

7
00:00:25,140 --> 00:00:27,940
Instead of just giving me a name

8
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:30,140
Play with each other

9
00:00:32,490 --> 00:00:33,890
Okay, I'm sleepy

10
00:00:33,890 --> 00:00:34,890
go home

11
00:00:34,890 --> 00:00:36,690
You two carry the remaining supplies

12
00:00:36,690 --> 00:00:53,850
I can understand that the boss has brought back another female subordinate.

13
00:00:53,850 --> 00:00:56,050
But why did you bring back such an ugly one?

14
00:01:00,470 --> 00:01:02,670
This is the new applicable female subordinate

15
00:01:02,670 --> 00:01:04,600
You two help her clean up first.

16
00:01:04,600 --> 00:01:17,470
Teach her the rules by the way

17
00:01:17,470 --> 00:01:20,070
Let's go, let's take you to take a bath first

18
00:01:20,070 --> 00:01:22,760
The boss likes cleanliness

19
00:01:22,760 --> 00:01:23,960
I really don't understand

20
00:01:23,960 --> 00:01:25,760
Why does the boss charge this?

21
00:01:25,760 --> 00:01:28,160
An old and ugly woman serves as a subordinate
